  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Stackable_Stew_and_Soup/BH_SSAS_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">使用此模组后，您可以将默认的炖菜和汤类食物堆叠至同一物品栏槽位最多8个（可配置）。这样一来，这类食物将更加实用，成为长途旅行的理想选择。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友们联机游玩的服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Stackable_Stew_and_Soup/BH_SSAS_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找能与朋友畅玩任意模组或整合包的服务器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 正是您需要的解决方案！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>并使用优惠码\"Lupin\"即可享受25%折扣。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Stackable_Stew_and_Soup/BH_SSAS_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模组的目标很简单：优化 Minecraft 中碗装食物的使用体验。在原版设定中，这些食物无法堆叠——考虑到它们提供的饱食度或许有一定道理，但我们认为能在同一空间携带最多8碗食物会是更好的选择。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Stackable_Stew_and_Soup/BH_SSAS_banner3.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>是否兼容其他碗装食物模组？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">与绝大多数同类模组兼容，这些模组通常仅修改原版碗装食物以添加新配方。如遇任何兼容性问题，我们也会积极解决。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支持服务器环境吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！运行完美！请记住，与好友畅玩模组的最佳方式就是使用BisectHosting——<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接可享25%折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模组可用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！但仅限在Modrinth或CurseForge平台发布的整合包。将模组上传至其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，严格禁止。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其加入您在Modrinth或CurseForge的整合包，我们将不胜感激。如需任何微调或有疑问，欢迎联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以录制模组视频并在我的频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！您可以在频道中自由游玩此模组或我们的任何整合包并制作视频，我们对此表示衷心感谢！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Stackable_Stew_and_Soup/BH_SSAS_banner2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/18/stackable-stew-and-soup-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/20/stackable-stew-and-soup-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oXpHOu9DzUg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></span></p>",
